WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.040
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.610
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.790
It's a monster you summon by 
releasing a Warrior-Type monster.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.680
It becomes stronger depending 
on the monster that's released.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.950
Shadows, show yourself!

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.530
The light has turned into shadows.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.100
Dark Synchro Summoning lets me summon 
a Synchro Monster whose Level is

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.100
equal to the non-Tuner Monster's Level 
subtracted by the Dark Tuner's Level.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.260
No way.  You can't subtract 
Level 8 from Level 3!

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:54.750
In the shadow world, a negative 
Level 5 monster exists.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:56.660
No way…

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.550
When shadow stacks on shadows, the 
door to the realm of the dead opens.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.960
A world without light!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.800
Dark Synchro!

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.330
Come!  Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:24.920
Dark Tuning?  I can't believe it.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:53.680
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:58.780
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.690
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:08.460
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.830
No matter how bad today is

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.810
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.210
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:28.280
Is light it myself

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:33.280
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:38.250
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:44.550
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.530
Today will never exist again

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:54.430
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:24.350
Darkness That Swallows Everything
Invincible Dark Signer

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.700
We caught our prey.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.090
Which of the two is it?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.290
Yusei Fudo.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.120
The new King.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.720
Let's witness his power.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:13.590
What is that?  A hologram?

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:21.250
Like I thought, it's Yusei 
Fudo!  Why is he dueling here?

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.890
Alright...

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:26.350
The new King suddenly left the stadium, 
and no one knew where he went!

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:30.470
He's secretly having a 
street duel!  What a scoop!

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:39.160
That light is glowing again!  
And the opponent has one too!

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.960
Dark Tuner Catastrogue's monster effect.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:49.340
When this monster is used to Synchro Summon, 
one card on your field is destroyed!

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:49.900
What?

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.590
Junk Warrior!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:00.030
I never heard of a Dark Tuner before!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.100
I've never seen that other monster either.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:06.220
Frozen Fitzgerald attacks you directly.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.750
Go!  Blizzard Strike!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.510
I activate my trap!

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:12.520
What?

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:17.090
When Frozen Fitzgerald 
attacks, you can't activate

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:22.090
spell or trap cards until 
the end of the Damage Step.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.650
What was that?

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.960
No way!  This isn't a hologram?

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.570
There's an invisible wall.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:46.230
Until the end of the duel, 
you cannot escape from here.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:50.190
You're also a Signer?

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.690
I end my turn.

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:54.180
My turn!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:59.870
No matter who you are, all I have to 
do is believe in my cards and fight!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:03.270
I activate my trap Descending Lost Star!

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:06.910
I Special Summon a Synchro Monster 
from my graveyard in defense position!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.490
Come, Junk Warrior!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:16.720
Then I release Junk Warrior 
to summon Turret Warrior!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:25.470
Turret Warrior gains attack points equal to

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:28.470
the released Warrior-Type 
monster's attack points.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:33.100
Battle!  Attack Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.990
No way...

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.720
Frozen Fitzgerald's monster effect.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.900
When I have no monsters on 
my field, if the monster was

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:09.900
destroyed in battle, then it is 
Special Summoned in defense position.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.290
What?

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:19.670
At the end of the Battle Phase, all monsters 
that attacked this monster are destroyed.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.200
Turret Warrior!

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.130
What an incredible monster effect!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:34.060
Even if I destroy Frozen Fitzgerald, it keeps

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:38.060
resurrecting back to his field, and 
I continue to lose my monsters.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.390
A Dark Signer will never be defeated.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:45.030
Along with my black symbol, 
I will continue to resurrect.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.110
Dark Signer?

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:52.690
The time for us to swallow your red 
marks in darkness is approaching.

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:55.370
What do you know?

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.940
This duel is telling you.

00:07:58.940 --> 00:07:59.840
What?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:03.670
Everything you cling to 
in this world will vanish.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.750
Just like the monsters on your field.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.370
Stop messing around!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.610
The spell card One for One!

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:13.350
I send a monster card in my hand to the

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.350
graveyard to Special Summon 
a Level 1 monster in my hand!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.610
Come, Sonic Chick!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.640
I end my turn!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:30.600
That monster can't be destroyed when it 
battles a monster with 1900-or-more attack points.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:36.740
The bond with my friends and my hope for 
victory will never vanish from my field!

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:38.840
That's how I duel!

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:43.140
Then I'll blow away your life points!

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.740
My turn!

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:47.740
I switch Frozen Fitzgerald 
to attack position.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.960
Then I equip Drain Strike.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.260
When it attacks a monster 
in defense position,

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.260
if my monster's attack points 
are greater than your

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.260
monster's defense points, you 
take damage equal to half

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.260
the difference, and I regain 
the same number of life points.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.710
Battle!  Attack Sonic Chick!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.580
Blizzard Strike!

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.940
Only 100 life points left?

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.650
If the new King loses…

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:30.810
Only I'll have the scoop!  Incredible!

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:41.920
Your remaining life points 
symbolizes your fate.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.130
What are you trying to say?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:48.940
The time for Satellite's destruction is near.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:49.580
What?

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:54.280
What I saw back then…

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:57.210
You do know something!

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:00.210
You will not be around 
to witness that moment!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.830
I end my turn!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.030
I won't let you do whatever you want!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.490
My turn!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.510
I summon Nitro Synchron!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:20.890
Since a Tuner Monster is on my field, I can 
Special Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.220
The Continuous Trap Graceful Revival!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:31.130
I can summon a Level 2-or-below 
monster from my graveyard!

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:33.620
Appear, Speed Warrior!

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:41.890
Nitro Synchron tunes the three monsters 
Sonic Chick, Speed Warrior and Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:49.970
The wishes come together to form a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.280
Synchro Summon!

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.040
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:00.530
Due to Nitro Synchron's monster 
effect, I draw one card!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:04.280
I equip Junk Barrage on to Nitro Warrior!

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:15.160
Since a spell was activated this turn, Nitro

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:19.160
Warrior gains 1000 attack 
points once when it battles.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.550
Battle!  Attack Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.170
Junk Barrage's effect.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:39.440
When it destroys a monster in battle, you take 
damage equal to half that monster's attack points!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:47.820
However, Frozen Fitzgerald keeps on reviving!

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:11.190
Frozen Fitzgerald keeps on reviving!

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.500
I was waiting for that!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.620
When Nitro Warrior destroys a 
monster, your monster in defense

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:25.620
position switches to attack position, 
and the battle continues!

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:32.160
The flames of anger don't falter 
even against thick ice walls!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.310
Nitro Warrior, attack!

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:38.590
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.470
Take Junk Barrage's effect again!

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:05.070
That was the duel of the new King.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.240
I did it!  Only I have this incredible scoop!

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.040
Hey, wake up!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.590
What's going to happen 
to Satellite?  Answer me!

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:29.790
Satellite?

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:32.960
Ouch!  Why am I hurt?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.980
Where am I?

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.690
You don't remember anything?

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.850
The mark has vanished?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.180
Dick?  Aren't you Dick Pit?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.080
What's a street duelist doing here?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.380
Who are you?

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:56.380
I'm Carly, a newspaper reporter.  Umm…

00:13:56.880 --> 00:14:01.370
What happened in this duel?

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:05.330
There were real explosions, a-and…

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.710
Dick, why are you here?

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.390
I really don't remember.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:11.690
Just one quote.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:14.290
I really don't know!  Stop pushing me!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.180
Dick, you're a street duelist, right?

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:20.250
The Dark Tuner and Dark Synchro 
Monster have also vanished.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.470
I really don't know what's going on.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:28.140
Are you sure?  Search the 
thread of your memories.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.370
Thread?

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.370
Come to think of it, I think I saw a thread.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:39.840
Afterwards, I instantly lost consciousness.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.210
Hang in there!

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:44.540
Security?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.120
It seems they found out about this duel.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.220
What should we do?

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.000
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.440
Wait a second!  We're still 
in the middle of an interview!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:56.850
Wait!

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.110
Don't leave me behind.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.630
What are you doing?  Let me go!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.650
My scoop!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.150
Did you do this?

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.790
We let one of our prey escape.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.740
This was just an introduction.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:45.820
We're like opposite poles on a magnet.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.810
In time, they will follow 
the thread and come here.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:53.930
But more importantly, what's 
going on with the other one?

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:12.430
Where have you been all morning?

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:15.730
I was dueling against a man 
who had a mark on his arm.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.850
What?  Was it the fifth Signer?

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:21.120
No, he said he was a Dark Signer.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.610
Dark Signer?

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:29.200
That mark…  They may be the real 
enemy that we're supposed to fight.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.380
They've showed up.

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:44.600
Are you sure that this is okay?

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:48.050
I expected them to show up.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:53.340
Now that the Signers are awake, it's 
destiny that they would also wake up.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.280
Give me one.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.670
Hey!

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.550
Hope!

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.940
Hope for Satellite!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:16.500
The Crimson Dragon that 
appeared above Neo Domino City

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:20.000
is an evil god that will bring 
catastrophe to the world!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:26.520
Will the evil god's anger fall on both 
City and Satellite, destroying them both?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:32.420
No!  The Crimson Dragon chose 
the City, the land of fools!

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:37.260
The wise citizens of 
Satellite, keep hope alive!

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:43.320
The people who join us will 
be saved from this curse!

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:48.320
Hope.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:50.280
Hope.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.540
Hope for Satellite!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.830
Hope for Satellite!

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.600
Crimson Dragon, vanish!  Vanish!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.690
Stop it!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.850
The curse of the Crimson Dragon?  
What are you basing that on?

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:08.970
Stop it, Rally.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.560
Don't you know that Yusei became the King?

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:16.360
The Duel King is from Satellite!

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.750
The King is from Satellite?

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:25.480
Since the Crimson Dragon appeared during 
Yusei's duel, that means it brought hope!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.290
You fool!  Stop!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.790
What are you doing, Blitz?

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.940
Crimson Dragon?

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.090
He called the Crimson Dragon?

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.630
Crimson Dragon…

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.360
What's going on?

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.730
Ignore them.  Let's go!

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:44.140
It's true!  If you think I'm 
lying, then check for yourself!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.010
I don't believe it!

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:52.670
They're saying that he's not really the King!

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:57.960
Jack had 0 life points!  
Yusei definitely won!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:01.770
Who wrote that horrible article?

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:08.330
Whenever the citizens of Satellite try to 
rise up, the City people always smashes us down.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:10.960
I've been searching everywhere.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.660
Who are you?

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.550
A person who has a message of hope for you.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.340
What's this?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:26.270
Angela didn't even get a single 
quote from the new King!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:30.930
How dare she write such a careless 
article!  How frustrating!

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:32.440
Be quiet!

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.830
Stay quiet until it's your 
turn to be interrogated!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:39.430
I'm sorry.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:43.260
It makes me want to cry.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.790
By drawing this card, today's fortune 
is that I'll be in big trouble and

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:53.790
that my rival will extend her lead over 
me.  Therefore, I have to try harder.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.270
But how am I supposed to try 
harder in a place like this?

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.690
Be quiet!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:09.690
Drink.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:10.430
Thanks.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.380
Bro, have you been able to contact Saiga yet?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:25.950
I'm thinking of going back to Satellite.  
I'm worried about what that guy said.

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.470
Go back?

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:31.240
About Satellite being destroyed?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.230
Yeah.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.320
You're leaving?

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:38.260
You're going home to Satellite?

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:39.990
Yusei.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.350
There's something I need to investigate.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:48.550
But isn't Satellite really dangerous?

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:53.150
Don't go back there.  
Stay with us in the City!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:57.400
Yusei, you're the one who said that 
the Signers have to stay together!

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:09.600
Since we're both Signers, 
we'll definitely meet again.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.740
Yusei…

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.280
Can you hear me, you piece 
of Satellite garbage!

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:31.270
There's no safe place for you in the City!

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:35.920
I'm coming up right now, so prepare yourself!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.420
Why does it have to be now?

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:39.800
It's perfect timing.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.360
I also need to speak with Godwin.

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:17.960
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:23.040
We will build our own future

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:28.470
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:33.650
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:48.790
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:54.370
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:59.070
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:04.330
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.340 --> 00:23:08.810
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.010 --> 00:23:14.390
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:19.260
This journey has no end

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:24.730
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:29.970
Hear my voice
